# Cargo build output. `Cargo.lock` is NOT here: this crate produces a binary,
# and a binary's dependency graph is part of what was reviewed -- doubly so
# while three transitive versions are pinned back by hand (ADR-009).
src-tauri/target/

# Regenerated by `tauri-build` on every build from `tauri.conf.json` and the
# capabilities directory. Committing it means a diff on every build that says
# nothing, and a merge conflict in a file nobody edits.
src-tauri/gen/schemas/

# `dist/` IS AUTHORED HERE, unlike everywhere else in this repository.
#
# The root .gitignore excludes `dist/` because it is build output in every
# other package. This one is not: it is a single hand-written HTML file, the
# failure screen the shell serves when its sidecar will not start, and there is
# no build step that could regenerate it. `tauri.conf.json` names it as
# `frontendDist`, so an ignored copy means a packaged shell with no page to
# show when it has something to say.
!dist/
!dist/index.html
